      "type": "section-heading-and-text",
      "name": "Heading & Text",
      "settings": {
        "metaobject_content": "",
        "heading": "<h2><strong>Why Choose </strong>a Rack or Rig?</h2>",
        "paragraph": "<p>Whether you're building your first home gym or upgrading a commercial facility, a quality <a href=\"/collections/squat-power-racks-rigs-accessories\" title=\"Squat Racks & Accessories\"><strong>squat rack</strong> </a>or rig forms the backbone of your strength training and <a href=\"/collections/weight-lifting\" title=\"Weight Lifting\">weight lifting</a>.</p><p>Northern's <em>Racks & Rigs</em> deliver exceptional strength, versatility, and safety — without the premium price tag you'd expect from commercial-grade equipment.</p><p>Our collection includes<strong> </strong>power racks for maximum enclosed safety and <a href=\"/products/half-rack-olympic-20kg-bar-100kg-bumper-plate-set-adjustable-bench-package\" title=\"Half Rack Package with Barbell, Plates & Bench\"><strong>half racks</strong></a> for space-efficient setups. Both deliver the same uncompromising build quality and extensive customisation options that serious lifters demand.</p>"
      }
    },
