          "settings": {
            "heading": "Unbeatable Value",
            "content": "We believe premium equipment shouldn't require a premium budget. By designing in the UK and optimizing our supply chain, we deliver commercial-quality racks at prices typically reserved for entry-level equipment. You're getting the same materials, construction methods, and weight capacities as racks costing £500-£1000 more — backed by our lifetime frame warranty",
