    "instant_vb_ilz_zp_q3_b_bfx_iyv_CXMQyJ": {
      "type": "instant-VbIlzZpQ3BBfxIYV",
      "name": "NOR : Rack Comparison ",
      "settings": {
        "text_geDZStQw9blkD8aI": "<h3><strong>Choose a </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Power</strong></span><strong> Rack</strong></h3><h3><strong>If You:</strong></h3>",
        "text_WK0EVbhJ5NyXCKzt": "<p><strong>Ideal For : </strong></p>",
        "text_pFoqcZEKMzBm4FCy": "<p>Home gyms with dedicated space, powerlifters, solo trainers prioritising safety, progressive overload training</p>",
        "url_ugREKWEhLP5vSzjQ": "shopify://collections/squat-power-racks-rigs-accessories",
        "text_OHng7eXVpIACB4kT": "<p>Build a Power Rack</p>",
        "text_KJXIdxhoOuGdzOFo": "<p><strong>Train solo frequently</strong></p>",
        "text_qLWB2ckfEx4aZ5S5": "<p>Four-post enclosed design with integrated safety spotters means you can push to failure safely, even without a training partner</p>",
        "text_XVM2fqsIMQrF5g1Q": "<p><strong>Perform heavy compound lifts</strong></p>",
        "text_OOsdRaqsYUunc5rQ": "<p>Squats, bench press, overhead press with maximal loads require maximum safety infrastructure</p>",
        "text_hDa2XTDntS5dpYMt": "<p><strong>Want all-in-one functionality</strong></p>",
        "text_EHAexW9V5KXZrD8M": "<p>Full enclosure allows exercises inside the rack, with safety bars preventing barbell drops from hitting the floor</p>",
        "text_uZoMQ9V8JhiWS5gK": "<p><strong>Need integrated storage</strong></p>",
        "text_LiwEYfvYOhoAIlV9": "<p>Six-post design includes rear plate storage horns, keeping your training area organised and weights within arm's reach</p>",
        "text_4xxQPdOd3gpOwLcz": "<p><strong>Value maximum safety</strong></p>",
        "text_jUs6NlJoUEJzYibw": "<p>Safety bars on all four sides provide protection regardless of lift direction or failure point</p>",
        "text_9t8XXaolOKdo6hVo": "<h3><strong>Choose a </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Half</strong></span><strong> Rack</strong></h3><h3><strong>If You:</strong></h3>",
        "text_B5OWle0XA46ACNkB": "<p><strong>Ideal For : </strong></p>",
        "text_z6P4pku8pzAIVA2Q": "<p>Garage gyms, PT studios, CrossFit-style training, budget-conscious serious lifters, versatile training programs</p>",
        "url_ARJBuXDFQxta6rBq": "shopify://products/northern-half-rack",
        "text_hKd6CnegZNzZceaK": "<p>Build a Half Rack</p>",
        "text_m4Y9VpUIFirklrSp": "<p><strong>Have limited space</strong></p>",
        "text_Vi0EajTQuquogSoZ": "<p>Compact footprint with open front design maximises training area efficiency</p>",
        "text_24EtomTeso4HYLt1": "<p><strong>Prefer open movement</strong></p>",
        "text_lHFEtOyZS5DVy31M": "<p>No front posts means unrestricted entry/exit and less claustrophobic feel during lifts</p>",
        "text_qOB959cL6RdNX7jo": "<p><strong>Want versatility</strong></p>",
        "text_2vq9pk4h7if7mIqM": "<p>Easy to work around the rack for accessory movements, plyometrics, and dynamic training</p>",
        "text_O6IAgypXIN9BOpp9": "<p><strong>Train multiple people</strong></p>",
        "text_7dn9iZdTXsIZUzQq": "<p>Open design allows easier equipment sharing and spotter positioning</p>",
        "text_PmGlZcTkuv2O0u9a": "<p><strong>Need budget efficiency</strong></p>",
        "text_RuQVJ1Lf6YfmqJuX": "<p>Lower material costs translate to savings without sacrificing structural integrity or weight capacity</p>",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
